I think your arithmetic is right. However, if true, then after 6348
corpses one would expect a 50-50 chance of seeing an artifact drop.

(9159/9160)^6348 ~ 0.5

After 21000 corpses it becomes a 90% chance of at least one of them
being an artifact.

(9159/9160)^21000 ~ 0.1

Many games achieve this number of corpses; pudding farmers often go
far, far above it. Even factoring in that the corpse type has an
effect -- small corpses will not leave large objects, Kops and many
other monsters don't leave drops -- it's odd that nobody has ever
seen one, ever.


